			"text": "🟡 load_json_file(path) → Any\n\n▸ Reads a file from disk\n▸ Path(path).read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n▸ Tries FileNotFoundError → \"Input file not found\"\n▸ Tries JSONDecodeError → \"Invalid JSON\"\n▸ Returns raw parsed JSON (dict/list)\n▸ Used by both loader functions below",
