			"text": "🔴 write_output(path, items) → None\n\n▸ Takes output path + iterable of OutputItem\n▸ Creates parent directory: Path(path).parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n▸ Serializes: [item.model_dump() for item in items]\n▸ Writes JSON: json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n▸ Writes to file: .write_text(content, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n▸ Called by pipeline.py after all prompts are decoded\n▸ Output directory is auto-created if it doesn't exist",
